# fix-wave3-firmware retry: IMU stall and read-failure injection on the final gate, 2026-10-07 (UTC). Serial, I (ms) is uptime; lines filtered to IMU, state and Wi-Fi. The Mac is off the device's network (no AP found, config mode at 62 s), so no backend; the IMU task runs regardless.
